---
description: Test placement, fakes and oracle style.
globs: tests/**/*.py
---

Read `.agents/conventions/tests.md`.

Plain `unittest` classes run under pytest, one file per module, no sockets and
no RNS. Use the existing seams: `Deps` collaborators, `PeerScheduler._open_link`
and friends, the injected `fetch` in `admin.ResolverClient`. Optional
dependencies get `skipUnless` while the logic tests around them still run.

Assert an accept or a reject, never merely that nothing raised. No
`except Exception: pass`, no checking that a reply has an `ok` key without
checking its value, no mock that always succeeds under a security oracle.
Every rejection path on the wire needs a test, and so does every trust
invariant: changing one should break a named test first.
